From 9f7c8d2b58f543e5ac1fdc9f2d540102c1a5b7d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GitHub Copilot <copilot@openai.invalid>
Date: Thu, 15 May 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] IFX: Add CRYPTOLITE transparent driver hooks

Port the Infineon CRYPTOLITE transparent PSA driver hooks into the
fetched tf-psa-crypto tree, following the existing MXCRYPTO integration
order. The CRYPTOLITE dispatch branches are inserted immediately after
MXCRYPTO in the wrapper paths and the required context/header plumbing is
added for hash, cipher, AEAD, MAC, key generation, key agreement, and
public key export.
